Fixed: The C++ FastScape mesh-deformation plugin now transports bedrock
elevation as a tracer while retaining conservative transport for sediment
thickness. This preserves constant topography during tangential advection.
Fresh runs that reuse an output directory also replace the previous sediment
budget instead of appending an unrelated history. A new parameter can disable
normal material velocity in isolated tangential-advection benchmarks.
<br>
(Michael Pons, 2026/08/05)
